proxshield downloads and runs third-party models at runtime. They are not part of the npm
package; the Docker image includes copies of the default models. Each keeps its own license:

- Llama Prompt Guard 2 22M (default injection model), Llama 4 Community License.
  Built with Llama. Llama 4 is licensed under the Llama 4 Community License,
  Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. All Rights Reserved.
  https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-Prompt-Guard-2-22M
  ONNX build: https://huggingface.co/gravitee-io/Llama-Prompt-Guard-2-22M-onnx
- protectai/deberta-v3-base-prompt-injection-v2 (optional), Apache-2.0
  https://huggingface.co/protectai/deberta-v3-base-prompt-injection-v2
- Xenova/bert-base-NER (default PII model), MIT, an ONNX build of dslim/bert-base-NER
  https://huggingface.co/Xenova/bert-base-NER
- openai/privacy-filter (optional), Apache-2.0
  https://huggingface.co/openai/privacy-filter
